  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The purpose of this dataset was to examine differences in nutrient cycling between alder shrub patches and open tundra locations. There are several hypotheses predicting the responses of these variables to shrub expansion, but few studies directly compare differences between these two communities. This dataset was designed to address this knowledge gap in green alder communities."
